        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-SIG777-P40, White Flush Pull with Flush Cover</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe White Flush Pull with Flush Cover is for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors, or any door where a flush with the door face pull is desired. The White Rectangular Flush Door Pull with Flush Cover features a spring loaded flush cover. The flush pull's opening is exposed with a gentle push of your finger. Remove your finger and the cover springs out re-concealing the pull's opening for the  ultimate clean appearance. The flush pull is pressure mounted into the door for a clean installation (no screws). It can also be thru bolted from the back side if used on pantry or cabinet door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG777_size.gif?v=1704354652\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the White Flush Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>White</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 5-5/16\" (135 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-3/4\" (70 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 3/4\" (19 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 21/32\" (17 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Height: 3-15/16\" (100 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Width: 1\" (25 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Height: 4-15/16\" (125 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Width: 1-13/16\" (46 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lip:  5/16\" (8 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Special Ordred Item. <b>No Returns</b></i>\r\n</p>",
